Wavefunctions and densities belong to the 'Recursive' class. Pass an integer \
argument into the property query to instantly evaluate arbitrary-order \
spatial derivatives.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->1314060934,ExpressionUUID->"d69d2eeb-fb41-49b9-839b-1ede48838db9"],

