Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Potential Models", "Subsection",
 CellID->713135363,ExpressionUUID->"7460d09e-c993-44e5-a705-51e3920a84ea"],

Cell["\<\
The PotentialModels registry contains the exact analytical time-evolution \
propagators available to the 1D engine. These models dictate how the \
wavepacket's kinematics and phases evolve over time. They can be invoked by \
passing their Template alias to the \"Potential\" option during wavepacket \
initialization. The dataset below also exposes the raw Backend Symbol linked \
to each template.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->559812034,ExpressionUUID->"303e885b-2a67-41a1-9555-8a87f71b49a2"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Inspect the available analytical potential models, their structural \
templates, and backend routing symbols.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->634997931,ExpressionUUID->"6ca3445b-5ec0-4270-8996-8920ae6c1531"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

