       FormBox["\<\"GWP1DSHAPE[A1, HBAR, MASS]\"\>", TextForm]], "InlineText",
       ExpressionUUID->"2b824921-76d6-4a5f-8a5f-70ae57c9134b"],
      Text["GWP1DSHAPE[A1, HBAR, MASS]"]], 
     PaneBox[
      InterpretationBox[Cell[BoxData[
        FormBox[
         StyleBox["\<\"Parses the user-provided wavepacket shape parameter A1 \
and translates it into the foundational real and imaginary width components \
