Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Expectation Values & Energies", "Subsection",
 CellID->371593653,ExpressionUUID->"9315b292-3e6e-4514-9cb5-1520d2931a91"],

Cell["\<\
Arbitrary-order expectations and cross-moments are resolved algebraically. \
Potential-coupled expectations evaluate exactly against the instantaneous \
potential landscape. Total energy moments (up to n=4) are available for \
variance, skewness, and kurtosis calculations.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->492080495,ExpressionUUID->"c3491a96-8f63-4917-8f2c-b0aead08a69b"],

Cell["\<\
Phase-space expectations form the core statistical observables of the \
wavepacket. The spatial and momentum evaluators support arbitrary-order \
polynomial generation directly from the parameter bus.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->437354868,ExpressionUUID->"560fa8af-420d-4bcc-826f-899a9b1e8284"],

