Cell["\<\
Just like phase-space variables, the cross-correlations between kinetic and \
potential energies can be evaluated algebraically to arbitrary polynomial \
orders.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->291358778,ExpressionUUID->"fe7ef4f7-0425-414b-accc-3e0b0ca67f72"],

